  "description": "Market was stagnant in December...its not anymore!",
  "body_html": "<p>The market is quiet…and then it is not. This is why I repeatedly say “do not run away” during the boring times. Now that we have some confirmation of a trend continuation, I am taking action. </p><p>One of the stocks I am purchasing is a new pick… that absolutely <em><strong>crushed</strong></em> cash flow expectations by +1,019,107%…yes you read that correctly. And no, it is not a penny stock; the market cap sits at $11.5B…our “sweet spot” range for high potential runners. This company has also been consistently growing in earnings per share annually. If you want a chance at a big % stock run, having blowout earnings certainly increases those chances. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><div class=\"image-link image2\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KVJM!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff806da9c-d2cc-4ad2-8a70-46e5c0456370_1166x59.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KVJM!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff806da9c-d2cc-4ad2-8a70-46e5c0456370_1166x59.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KVJM!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff806da9c-d2cc-4ad2-8a70-46e5c0456370_1166x59.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KVJM!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff806da9c-d2cc-4ad2-8a70-46e5c0456370_1166x59.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KVJM!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff806da9c-d2cc-4ad2-8a70-46e5c0456370_1166x59.png\" width=\"1166\" height=\"59\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/f806da9c-d2cc-4ad2-8a70-46e5c0456370_1166x59.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:59,&quot;width&quot;:1166,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:8805,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/183571291?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff806da9c-d2cc-4ad2-8a70-46e5c0456370_1166x59.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KVJM!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff806da9c-d2cc-4ad2-8a70-46e5c0456370_1166x59.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KVJM!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff806da9c-d2cc-4ad2-8a70-46e5c0456370_1166x59.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KVJM!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff806da9c-d2cc-4ad2-8a70-46e5c0456370_1166x59.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!KVJM!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff806da9c-d2cc-4ad2-8a70-46e5c0456370_1166x59.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div></div></div></div><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Over 1 million percent gain in cash flow from financing activities. </figcaption></figure></div><p>I am also adding to two of our current winning positions that are up 14.8% and the 2nd stock gapped up over 8% today. Recall when we reviewed the 2025 <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-summary-fc6?r=4z8lgl\">StockTok screener</a>, the biggest winners typically had massive gaps to the upside early on. One is a metals mining company, with an emphasis on copper. The 2nd company is a semiconductor packaging and test services. </p><p><em><strong>The stocks are: </strong></em></p>",
